WEBVTT

01:30.840 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:37.800 --> 01:39.120
Day after day,

01:39.880 --> 01:42.320
I nurtured you
with the spiritual power of my blood.

01:43.280 --> 01:44.640
You used my power to recover,

01:46.400 --> 01:48.520
yet betrayed me at the critical moment,

01:49.240 --> 01:51.280
sending me here with your own hands.

01:59.760 --> 02:02.040
It seems you've forgotten everything now.

02:23.240 --> 02:24.080
Pearl,

02:24.920 --> 02:25.840
how could you be here?

02:27.040 --> 02:28.360
Emperor Zhao Ming,

02:28.440 --> 02:29.720
you're arrogant beyond measure,

02:29.800 --> 02:30.920
burdened with sins.

02:31.840 --> 02:33.360
Today, by divine decree,

02:33.440 --> 02:35.400
you are sealed under the Lava,

02:36.000 --> 02:37.400
never to escape for all time.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.400
When I left,

02:42.240 --> 02:44.120
you said you'd wait for me at home.

02:45.400 --> 02:46.640
Why are you here now?

02:47.440 --> 02:49.840
I am the Chaos Pearl,
an ancient divine artifact,

02:50.400 --> 02:51.600
master of time and space,

02:51.680 --> 02:53.280
the force that upholds
the world's balance.

02:54.160 --> 02:56.320
How could you possibly keep me at home?

02:57.440 --> 02:58.680
Didn't you claim you loved me,

02:59.640 --> 03:01.240
wished to marry me,

03:01.840 --> 03:03.440
and stay by my side
for thousands of years?

03:03.520 --> 03:06.760
That was merely to repay
the nourishment I received

03:06.840 --> 03:09.000
from your power.

03:09.840 --> 03:12.280
I was born of chaos,
with an eternal lifespan.

03:12.880 --> 03:16.200
A thousand years to me
is but a fleeting instant.

03:17.160 --> 03:18.240
But now,

03:19.080 --> 03:21.520
driven by selfish ambition,
you ascended to slay the deities,

03:22.240 --> 03:24.840
defying heaven with reckless arrogance,
slaughtering innocents.

03:25.680 --> 03:27.560
I can no longer indulge you like this.

03:28.280 --> 03:29.240
No,

03:30.360 --> 03:31.520
you are not Pearl.

03:32.600 --> 03:33.560
Who are you?

03:35.320 --> 03:36.680
As expected of a mere mortal,

03:37.280 --> 03:38.920
your mind is inevitably consumed
by greed, anger, and ignorance.

03:39.600 --> 03:42.320
Even now, you deceive yourself.

03:43.320 --> 03:44.800
If I am not Pearl,

03:46.640 --> 03:49.200
could there possibly be
a second Chaos Pearl in this world?

03:51.640 --> 03:55.000
The Celestial Ladder was once a bridge
between the human and divine realms.

03:56.360 --> 03:58.880
Due to Emperor Zhao Ming's rebellion,

03:59.520 --> 04:01.200
it is now abolished.

04:01.880 --> 04:05.400
From now on, humans shall have
no means to ascend to heaven.

04:45.600 --> 04:47.560
I was sealed underground
by the Book of Fate.

04:48.400 --> 04:50.280
At the same time,
the Celestial Ladder collapsed,

04:51.000 --> 04:52.800
giving rise to the Lava.

04:53.840 --> 04:56.520
I was sealed under it for 10,000 years.

05:08.680 --> 05:10.160
After 10,000 years,

05:11.520 --> 05:13.200
the same face remains.

05:14.360 --> 05:16.040
The more innocent it seems,

05:16.600 --> 05:18.360
the more sinister it is.

05:21.880 --> 05:23.560
Since you've come,

05:23.640 --> 05:26.120
let me think carefully

05:27.160 --> 05:28.680
how to pay you back!

05:40.560 --> 05:42.760
Back then, I nurtured you
with the spiritual power of my blood.

05:42.840 --> 05:44.720
Today, with this blood array,

05:45.640 --> 05:48.120
I shall reclaim everything

05:48.640 --> 05:49.880
that was once mine.

05:51.880 --> 05:54.160
The Chaos Pearl is the artifact of time,

05:54.240 --> 05:55.920
master of temporal power,

05:56.680 --> 05:59.000
capable of reversing time
and the universe.

05:59.600 --> 06:02.560
The Chaos Saintess of the past
was so lofty and unapproachable.

06:03.360 --> 06:05.320
Look at you now,

06:05.400 --> 06:06.840
so wretched and pitiful,

06:07.520 --> 06:09.600
unable to withstand even a blood array.

06:13.560 --> 06:14.920
Beg for mercy,

06:15.600 --> 06:17.400
admit your betrayal,

06:17.480 --> 06:18.920
confess your sins,

06:19.000 --> 06:20.200
and plead for my forgiveness.

06:21.480 --> 06:23.000
I am merely myself,

06:23.760 --> 06:25.200
not some Chaos Saintess.

06:25.800 --> 06:27.440
I have never experienced

06:27.520 --> 06:28.640
everything you claim.

06:29.280 --> 06:30.640
Nor do I possess

06:31.240 --> 06:33.000
the divine power to reverse the universe.

06:34.560 --> 06:36.560
But if you expect me to beg you for mercy,

06:38.320 --> 06:40.240
-keep dreaming.
-Keep dreaming?

06:42.520 --> 06:44.760
I truly wonder, if Xie Xuechen
saw you like this,

06:44.840 --> 06:46.640
what would he think?

06:46.720 --> 06:48.520
If you have any hard feelings,
take them out on me!

06:48.600 --> 06:49.440
Don't drag him into this!

06:50.680 --> 06:51.760
You care for him!

06:58.040 --> 07:00.360
Now he's here. Xuanling!

07:03.720 --> 07:06.120
Who allowed you to come?
This array is dangerous. Leave quickly!

07:06.720 --> 07:07.760
I'll take you out of here.

07:08.440 --> 07:09.720
Out of here?

07:17.720 --> 07:18.560
Who exactly are you?

07:18.640 --> 07:20.040
I am…

07:20.640 --> 07:21.560
Zhao Ming.

07:22.320 --> 07:23.520
You are Emperor Zhao Ming?

07:24.840 --> 07:25.920
You…

07:26.680 --> 07:27.640
are also Zhao Ming.

07:33.640 --> 07:36.040
Back then, I ascended
to the heavens with a sword,

07:37.040 --> 07:39.120
and none of the deities
could stand against me.

07:39.880 --> 07:42.160
If not for the Chaos Pearl's betrayal,

07:42.680 --> 07:44.720
I would have destroyed
the Divine Clan long ago

07:44.800 --> 07:46.520
and would never have been sealed
under the Lava for 10,000 years!

07:47.360 --> 07:49.120
Recently, Sang Qi's practice
of the Jade Vault Technique

07:49.200 --> 07:51.040
stirred demonic energy,

07:52.280 --> 07:54.080
and that's how I sensed you.

07:55.040 --> 07:56.280
I then realized

07:57.440 --> 07:59.520
a fragment of my soul
remained in the world.

08:00.400 --> 08:02.200
You and I may look alike,

08:02.280 --> 08:04.640
but how does that prove
I am a part of your soul?

08:06.800 --> 08:08.000
Jun Tian,

08:08.080 --> 08:09.600
it's been 10,000 years,

08:10.320 --> 08:12.000
and you've become like this.

08:12.960 --> 08:14.320
Return to me.

08:30.520 --> 08:32.320
This is your true form.

08:36.000 --> 08:37.799
You ask how I know?

08:38.400 --> 08:40.799
Because at any time, I can kill you.

08:43.640 --> 08:45.640
Xie Xuechen! Xie Xuechen…

08:50.320 --> 08:52.520
A true power needs no lies for nobodies.

08:52.600 --> 08:54.120
If I say you are,

08:55.120 --> 08:56.560
then you are.

08:57.400 --> 09:00.600
You are merely a tiny fragment of me,
left in the human realm.

09:01.160 --> 09:02.680
These twenty-some years of your life

09:03.280 --> 09:05.280
are but a fleeting moment to me.

09:08.120 --> 09:08.960
Neither heaven nor fate,

09:10.200 --> 09:11.680
and certainly not you,

09:11.760 --> 09:13.080
can define me.

09:13.680 --> 09:14.880
Even if you are Emperor Zhao Ming,

09:15.480 --> 09:16.840
a deity of 10,000 years,

09:17.440 --> 09:19.800
today, I will still take her away

09:19.880 --> 09:20.800
from here.

09:31.120 --> 09:32.880
Jun Tian's sword energy
weighs thousands of tons,

09:32.960 --> 09:34.360
yet lands without damage.

09:34.440 --> 09:35.560
Could it be

09:35.640 --> 09:37.840
we are inside an illusion
constructed by his mind?

09:37.920 --> 09:39.680
Everything before us is but an illusion.

09:39.760 --> 09:41.480
In reality, Jun Tian
remains in your grasp!

10:01.320 --> 10:03.480
It seems you're still living
10,000 years ago.

10:03.560 --> 10:06.000
Now, times have changed,

10:06.720 --> 10:07.720
and so has everything else.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.080
Xie Xuechen,

10:15.720 --> 10:17.480
one day, you will return.

10:22.120 --> 10:22.960
Is everyone alright?

10:24.240 --> 10:25.520
Did any Dark Clan members escape?

10:25.600 --> 10:27.800
Rest assured, Mr. Xie,
none of them escaped.

10:28.920 --> 10:30.600
However, a report just arrived.

10:30.680 --> 10:32.200
The Spirit Clan attacked several sects,

10:32.280 --> 10:33.160
the Snow City,

10:33.240 --> 10:35.800
the Xuantian Sect, and the Mirage Palace
have settled the battles,

10:36.560 --> 10:39.040
but at the Jade Sky Palace,
the losses were heavy.

11:16.240 --> 11:18.720
Father, Mother, you're awake!

11:18.800 --> 11:20.560
-Sheng…
-How are you?

11:20.640 --> 11:21.480
Sheng.

11:21.560 --> 11:22.840
-Are you alright?
-I'm fine.

11:22.920 --> 11:24.640
Mother, I'm fine.

11:24.720 --> 11:26.040
What's the situation
at the Jade Sky Palace?

11:26.120 --> 11:27.800
The Spirit Clan has been driven away.

11:28.920 --> 11:29.760
The Jade Sky Palace is safe now.

11:33.320 --> 11:34.880
Thank you, Mr. Xie,

11:34.960 --> 11:36.760
for saving
the Jade Sky Palace from crisis.

11:41.840 --> 11:43.200
Both of you, please rest well.

11:44.160 --> 11:45.360
I'll handle the aftermath.

12:13.000 --> 12:14.360
For the remaining time,

12:16.160 --> 12:17.360
spend it well with them.

12:19.440 --> 12:21.880
-Dear, here.
-Look at you.

12:25.760 --> 12:26.760
Take care.

12:37.240 --> 12:38.320
How are they?

12:42.920 --> 12:44.400
Master Fu and Elder Duan

12:45.480 --> 12:46.320
sacrificed themselves to withstand

12:46.400 --> 12:47.440
the attack
from the Self-destructive Array.

12:48.040 --> 12:49.360
Now their injuries are too severe,

12:49.880 --> 12:51.120
and there's no saving them.

12:51.720 --> 12:52.880
At this point,

12:54.960 --> 12:56.280
it's merely their last spark of life.

13:00.240 --> 13:01.360
Let the remaining time

13:02.520 --> 13:03.800
be spent with their family.

13:05.040 --> 13:06.480
Jiang Li has already been captured.

13:06.560 --> 13:07.560
Let's go question him.

13:10.440 --> 13:11.400
Father.

13:12.160 --> 13:13.400
Sheng…

13:13.480 --> 13:15.120
If not for saving me,

13:15.200 --> 13:16.960
you wouldn't be this badly hurt.

13:17.560 --> 13:18.760
It's all my fault.

13:19.360 --> 13:20.680
If only I had trained harder,

13:20.760 --> 13:21.960
become stronger in my spiritual power.

13:22.040 --> 13:24.560
If only I had realized
Jiang Li's true identity earlier…

13:24.640 --> 13:25.840
Foolish child,

13:26.720 --> 13:28.000
this isn't your fault,

13:28.840 --> 13:29.800
and you shouldn't blame yourself.

13:31.800 --> 13:33.000
You've always been

13:33.080 --> 13:34.600
a kind and upright child

13:34.680 --> 13:36.920
since you were young,

13:37.000 --> 13:38.400
always optimistic and open-minded.

13:38.920 --> 13:40.200
So, this time,

13:41.680 --> 13:43.600
don't blame Cangli either.

13:44.840 --> 13:46.360
Don't let hatred consume you.

13:47.840 --> 13:48.880
It's just that…

13:52.760 --> 13:54.720
the road ahead…

13:57.600 --> 13:58.520
might truly…

13:59.720 --> 14:03.040
be one you'll have to walk alone.

14:03.120 --> 14:05.040
I hope that you can still live

14:06.480 --> 14:08.240
as happily and cheerfully

14:09.120 --> 14:10.080
as before.

14:11.000 --> 14:12.000
From now on,

14:12.640 --> 14:15.600
we won't push you to fight for
the Alliance Leader's position anymore.

14:15.680 --> 14:16.520
Forget about it.

14:17.680 --> 14:18.960
Sheng,

14:19.040 --> 14:20.640
just live…

14:22.440 --> 14:23.840
according to your own wishes.

14:26.120 --> 14:27.280
No, Mother…

14:27.920 --> 14:29.720
I want to be with you both!

14:30.480 --> 14:31.960
-Mother…
-Sheng…

14:32.040 --> 14:33.000
I don't want that…

14:34.320 --> 14:35.280
Don't be like this.

14:37.040 --> 14:38.160
If you act this way,

14:38.240 --> 14:40.280
your father and I won't rest easy.

14:40.360 --> 14:42.080
-I don't want that…
-Sheng…

14:44.440 --> 14:45.800
-Sheng…
-No…

14:46.400 --> 14:47.960
-No…
-Sheng…

14:48.040 --> 14:48.920
You've grown up…

14:52.120 --> 14:53.320
Your father and I…

14:53.400 --> 14:54.680
I don't want that…

14:56.280 --> 14:57.640
…don't want you

14:58.480 --> 14:59.480
to see us slowly dying…

15:01.360 --> 15:02.600
Be obedient.

15:03.640 --> 15:05.440
Go out now,

15:06.040 --> 15:07.320
alright?

15:07.400 --> 15:08.520
Lansheng,

15:09.040 --> 15:10.080
just think of it…

15:10.960 --> 15:13.080
as your mother and I
going on a long journey.

15:13.920 --> 15:15.080
I've never…

15:16.200 --> 15:18.880
taken your mother on a trip before.

15:20.240 --> 15:23.160
Good boy, no matter how far apart we are,

15:23.800 --> 15:25.280
we will always be here

15:25.360 --> 15:28.240
if you need us.

15:31.480 --> 15:33.800
Your father and I have lived
with dignity all our lives.

15:35.640 --> 15:37.120
At the very end…

15:38.800 --> 15:40.320
let us leave…

15:41.640 --> 15:43.480
with the same dignity.

15:44.600 --> 15:45.600
Sheng,

15:47.200 --> 15:48.680
don't make it hard for us

15:49.640 --> 15:51.560
to leave in peace.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.440
-Be good.
-Father…

15:54.040 --> 15:56.040
-Mother…
-Come.

15:56.640 --> 15:57.840
Son.

16:27.600 --> 16:28.800
Goodbye.

16:48.320 --> 16:49.360
Goodbye.

17:45.800 --> 17:47.440
Just sitting here waiting to die

17:48.560 --> 17:50.120
is so boring.

17:52.560 --> 17:53.680
Why don't we…

17:56.240 --> 17:57.320
Why don't we…

17:58.120 --> 17:59.440
do something?

18:05.760 --> 18:06.920
Right… Right now?

18:13.160 --> 18:14.320
After all these years,

18:14.920 --> 18:16.960
this is the first time
I'm doing your hair.

18:17.720 --> 18:19.280
And you dare to say that?

18:19.360 --> 18:21.840
I was afraid you'd scold me
if it wasn't done well.

18:22.480 --> 18:23.440
Yuanting,

18:25.280 --> 18:28.080
am I getting old? Look,

18:28.160 --> 18:29.360
I'm growing white hair.

18:29.440 --> 18:30.360
No! Don't pluck it!

18:31.280 --> 18:32.200
It'll grow back even more.

18:32.840 --> 18:34.200
Let me hide it for you.

18:35.920 --> 18:36.880
See?

18:36.960 --> 18:39.040
You still look as youthful as ever.

18:43.080 --> 18:45.800
In the blink of an eye,
a whole lifetime has passed.

18:49.800 --> 18:52.760
I still remember the first time
the elder brought me to meet you.

18:53.840 --> 18:55.640
It feels just like yesterday.

18:57.760 --> 18:59.480
I knew you had great taste.

19:00.560 --> 19:02.480
You must have chosen me for my looks,

19:03.200 --> 19:04.040
and that's why

19:04.800 --> 19:07.400
you didn't hesitate to marry me.
Isn't that right?

19:10.080 --> 19:11.640
Actually, I saw you long before that.

19:14.160 --> 19:15.400
I secretly went

19:15.480 --> 19:18.680
to the Jade Sky Palace
to watch your contest.

19:19.880 --> 19:21.080
During that match,

19:22.240 --> 19:24.840
your senior brothers, junior brothers,
senior sisters, and junior sisters…

19:24.920 --> 19:28.640
every one of them defeated you.

19:28.720 --> 19:30.840
You lost so badly.

19:34.080 --> 19:35.600
It was so embarrassing.

19:38.600 --> 19:39.680
But you finally chose me.

19:40.280 --> 19:42.880
You really do judge people by their looks.

19:44.680 --> 19:46.240
I was just curious…

19:47.720 --> 19:48.680
How could someone

19:49.440 --> 19:51.200
lose so miserably

19:52.080 --> 19:54.080
and still smile so happily?

19:55.480 --> 19:57.160
It was truly admirable.

19:58.920 --> 20:00.040
I thought

20:01.440 --> 20:04.560
if I could spend my life with someone

20:05.920 --> 20:08.120
as optimistic and cheerful as you,

20:09.360 --> 20:11.160
how wonderful it would be.

20:13.680 --> 20:15.080
Over the years,

20:16.160 --> 20:18.120
we've quarreled and argued.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.600
Most of the time,

20:21.240 --> 20:23.240
it was you putting up with my bad temper.

20:23.840 --> 20:25.800
If it had been someone else,

20:26.880 --> 20:28.880
they would've walked away long ago.

20:33.680 --> 20:34.640
Yuanting,

20:36.680 --> 20:37.920
marrying you

20:39.200 --> 20:40.200
was my greatest blessing.

20:41.440 --> 20:42.320
No,

20:43.240 --> 20:44.680
marrying you

20:44.760 --> 20:47.360
was the luckiest moment of my life.

20:48.120 --> 20:49.840
People say,

20:49.920 --> 20:51.080
I married you,

20:51.160 --> 20:52.200
the lioness of Hedong,

20:52.280 --> 20:54.360
for political gain and alliance.

20:54.440 --> 20:55.560
What nonsense!

20:56.640 --> 20:58.920
They don't see how good you are.

20:59.560 --> 21:01.080
Every time we're out,

21:01.800 --> 21:04.240
you always protect me,
your useless husband,

21:05.360 --> 21:07.640
and plan carefully for our child's future.

21:08.320 --> 21:09.520
You are a woman

21:09.600 --> 21:11.200
who dares to love, dares to hate,

21:12.480 --> 21:15.320
and never cares about others' opinions.

21:15.920 --> 21:17.600
The more time I spend with you,

21:18.120 --> 21:19.800
the more I respect you,

21:21.200 --> 21:22.560
and the more I love you.

22:26.440 --> 22:27.800
Sleep well.

23:40.200 --> 23:42.080
Why don't you kill me?

23:42.680 --> 23:44.080
If it weren't for Mr. Xie's orders,

23:44.720 --> 23:46.320
I would've killed you long ago

23:46.400 --> 23:49.040
to avenge my fallen people.

23:51.880 --> 23:52.840
Mr. Xie.

23:54.160 --> 23:55.200
We'd like to speak to him privately.

23:55.800 --> 23:56.760
Understood.

24:07.400 --> 24:10.080
I believe everything you've done
is for the Spirit Clan and Bao.

24:10.160 --> 24:12.200
But why do you obey He Xianwo

24:12.840 --> 24:13.960
and willingly let him use you?

24:14.480 --> 24:15.480
Is Bao safe?

24:18.080 --> 24:19.720
In this battle,

24:19.800 --> 24:21.920
both the Humans and Spirits
suffered heavy losses.

24:22.000 --> 24:24.280
So many innocent lives were lost
in a single moment.

24:24.360 --> 24:25.960
You and the Jade Sky Palace

24:26.760 --> 24:28.080
shared a deep connection,

24:28.720 --> 24:30.200
yet you turned on your clan,

24:30.280 --> 24:31.280
family against family.

24:32.480 --> 24:34.160
Is this truly the outcome you desired?

24:34.920 --> 24:35.840
Or…

24:37.200 --> 24:39.800
do you really believe
He Xianwo's path is the right one?

24:45.960 --> 24:47.320
He didn't manipulate me.

24:48.520 --> 24:49.920
Everything I've done

24:54.680 --> 24:55.600
was of my own will.

24:59.480 --> 25:01.040
Why do you trust him so much?

25:07.520 --> 25:09.840
After Xiu and I got married,

25:09.920 --> 25:10.960
we had Bao.

25:11.560 --> 25:14.880
I couldn't bear to see the two of them
fall into slavery.

25:14.960 --> 25:16.120
So,

25:16.920 --> 25:20.280
I decided to kill all the liars
in the Immortal Alliance

25:20.800 --> 25:21.920
and free the Spirit Clan.

25:24.240 --> 25:25.160
That day,

25:25.240 --> 25:27.400
I followed a ship full of spirit slaves

25:27.480 --> 25:28.920
to the Osprey Island.

25:29.000 --> 25:32.160
I wanted to kill their leader
and rescue the slaves.

25:33.280 --> 25:35.800
But his cultivation was far superior,
and he captured me.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.920
I thought I was doomed,

25:39.440 --> 25:40.560
but…

25:41.560 --> 25:42.720
he didn't kill me.

25:43.520 --> 25:44.600
Leave.

25:45.200 --> 25:46.400
Why don't you kill me?

25:48.680 --> 25:50.080
I'll give you three chances

25:51.200 --> 25:52.480
to kill me.

25:53.000 --> 25:55.400
I didn't know
what his true intentions were,

25:55.480 --> 25:57.040
but I had a feeling

25:57.120 --> 25:59.600
he was different from other cultivators.

26:00.920 --> 26:03.400
-So, I followed him.
-Greetings, Sir!

26:03.480 --> 26:05.400
I wanted to see what he was planning.

26:05.480 --> 26:06.680
Alright…

26:06.760 --> 26:07.920
-Everyone, take a seat!
-He kept his word.

26:08.000 --> 26:09.000
-Have a seat.
-He didn't make things hard for me.

26:09.080 --> 26:09.800
Greetings, Sir!

26:09.880 --> 26:11.520
He allowed me
to explore freely on the island.

26:12.560 --> 26:14.360
I followed him to a teahouse.

26:14.440 --> 26:15.600
Thank you.

26:15.680 --> 26:16.800
-I discovered that inside,
-Alright.

26:16.880 --> 26:18.320
everyone was from the Spirit Clan,

26:18.400 --> 26:20.880
even including the slaves
I wanted to rescue.

26:21.760 --> 26:22.920
They laughed,

26:23.000 --> 26:24.160
offered gifts…

26:24.240 --> 26:26.280
-Here are some eggs for you.
-Do you know?

26:26.360 --> 26:29.280
Their respect and gratitude
for He Xianwo were genuine.

26:29.800 --> 26:31.360
It turns out

26:31.440 --> 26:33.000
He Xianwo bought
that ship of spirit slaves

26:33.080 --> 26:34.800
-Here're some foreign fruits.
-to bring them

26:34.880 --> 26:36.160
to the Osprey Island to settle down.

26:36.240 --> 26:38.000
-Sir, here are some vegetables.
-He Xianwo…

26:38.080 --> 26:39.280
Please accept them.

26:39.360 --> 26:41.480
…is someone who truly treats

26:41.560 --> 26:43.640
both Humans and Spirits equally.

26:44.760 --> 26:46.240
I realized I had misunderstood him,

26:46.320 --> 26:47.840
so I gave up my plan to murder him.

26:47.920 --> 26:48.760
YINRAN TEAHOUSE

26:48.840 --> 26:50.240
At that time, all I wanted was to go home.

26:50.320 --> 26:52.000
But his men
wouldn't let me leave the island.

26:52.800 --> 26:55.160
It was then I understood

26:55.240 --> 26:56.880
he was serious

26:56.960 --> 26:58.160
about the three murder attempts.

26:58.240 --> 26:59.840
Your second attempt

27:00.640 --> 27:01.480
also failed.

27:02.840 --> 27:04.000
I misunderstood you.

27:04.640 --> 27:05.480
I'll leave the Osprey Island.

27:08.120 --> 27:09.120
It's fine.

27:09.960 --> 27:11.520
You still have a third chance.

27:12.440 --> 27:13.560
But I no longer want to kill you.

27:14.160 --> 27:15.200
All must

27:16.080 --> 27:18.000
pay the price

27:18.680 --> 27:19.920
for their mistakes.

27:24.800 --> 27:25.920
I had no choice

27:26.440 --> 27:27.840
but to try murdering him again.

27:35.160 --> 27:36.440
We have no ill will between us.

27:37.040 --> 27:39.040
If you want to kill me, then do it.
Why torment me?

27:44.160 --> 27:45.920
I never intended to kill you.

27:46.680 --> 27:47.640
On the contrary,

27:48.200 --> 27:49.680
I want to help you.

27:49.760 --> 27:50.680
Help me?

27:51.280 --> 27:53.000
You're clearly humiliating me!

27:53.760 --> 27:56.280
You don't even know what I want,
so how can you help me?

27:57.960 --> 27:59.080
Your real name is Fu Cangli.

28:00.680 --> 28:03.920
Your father was the master
of the Jade Sky Palace,

28:04.000 --> 28:05.480
Fu Yuanting's elder brother.

28:06.360 --> 28:07.360
Over a struggle for power,

28:08.120 --> 28:09.440
your father was killed.

28:09.520 --> 28:12.840
Your mother fled with you,

28:12.920 --> 28:14.600
giving you a new name.

28:15.400 --> 28:16.680
Jiang Li.

28:17.560 --> 28:21.000
Later, you married a treasure sniffer

28:21.600 --> 28:24.160
and had a daughter with her.

28:24.240 --> 28:26.200
Your daughter is named Bao.

28:26.280 --> 28:27.920
How do you know all this?

28:28.720 --> 28:30.000
Who exactly are you?

28:31.640 --> 28:33.160
These past few days, you've followed me

28:33.240 --> 28:35.040
all over the Osprey Island.

28:36.720 --> 28:38.040
Well,

28:38.120 --> 28:40.040
what do you think?

28:45.680 --> 28:46.640
This place is wonderful.

28:47.600 --> 28:49.800
Humans and Spirits coexist equally.

28:51.720 --> 28:53.440
But ultimately, it's not my home.

28:53.960 --> 28:54.960
I won't stay here.

28:56.400 --> 28:58.040
What if I told you

28:58.120 --> 28:59.360
I could make the whole world

28:59.440 --> 29:01.480
like this Osprey Island?

29:02.080 --> 29:03.360
You want to help the Spirit Clan?

29:04.160 --> 29:05.800
But you're Human. Why are you doing this?

29:06.520 --> 29:07.480
You're Human too.

29:07.560 --> 29:08.800
But my family is from the Spirit Clan.

29:08.880 --> 29:10.280
All beings should be equal,

29:13.080 --> 29:14.120
but Humans,

29:14.680 --> 29:16.160
just because they've
unlocked spiritual channels,

29:16.760 --> 29:18.440
think they can enslave

29:18.520 --> 29:19.880
and oppress other beings.

29:19.960 --> 29:21.320
This is wrong,

29:22.040 --> 29:23.320
and it must be corrected.

29:24.040 --> 29:25.760
We must also pay the price

29:27.240 --> 29:28.640
for this mistake.

29:31.400 --> 29:32.880
Even if that's what you believe,

29:34.640 --> 29:36.200
how can the Osprey Island alone

29:36.960 --> 29:38.080
stand against the Immortal Alliance?

29:39.400 --> 29:40.760
Why not?

29:40.840 --> 29:44.040
I've seen the Spirit warriors
he's secretly training.

29:44.120 --> 29:45.560
Why would that convince you?

29:45.640 --> 29:46.880
Why not?

29:47.480 --> 29:49.040
At that time,

29:49.560 --> 29:51.280
he had already proven
that he would treat the Spirit Clan well.

29:51.880 --> 29:54.000
I didn't care what his ultimate goal was.

29:54.080 --> 29:56.720
All that mattered to me was Bao and Xiu.

29:58.360 --> 30:00.800
For them, I'm willing to do anything.

30:01.640 --> 30:04.320
-Don't use me as an excuse!
-Bao…

30:04.400 --> 30:07.800
I hate war. I hate you
hurting my brothers and sisters!

30:08.400 --> 30:11.280
I like them. Without them,

30:11.360 --> 30:14.040
you wouldn't even see me alive now!

30:14.800 --> 30:16.000
Bao…

30:17.040 --> 30:20.320
Master Fu is dead. Elder Duan is dead too!

30:20.920 --> 30:23.840
Lansheng has lost his parents…

30:26.920 --> 30:28.280
Is the freedom you speak of

30:29.160 --> 30:31.080
just endless bloodshed
between the Humans and Spirits?

30:31.760 --> 30:33.160
Bao likes the Humans

30:33.240 --> 30:35.080
and gets along well with them.

30:35.160 --> 30:37.040
But everything you're doing now

30:38.120 --> 30:40.360
is pushing Bao into the abyss of hatred.

30:40.960 --> 30:45.160
In truth, deep down,
you don't care about me or Mother at all!

30:45.240 --> 30:47.280
You've been out so long,

30:47.920 --> 30:51.200
but all you did was kill!

30:56.000 --> 30:57.480
Xuanling…

31:03.640 --> 31:04.600
Bao…

31:07.760 --> 31:09.160
I let you down.

31:10.560 --> 31:11.960
I made you suffer.

31:18.600 --> 31:19.840
But you must believe…

31:23.200 --> 31:27.120
I've missed you every single day.

31:27.200 --> 31:28.160
And your mother.

31:29.960 --> 31:32.720
Every moment, I've longed
to reunite with you.

31:34.880 --> 31:36.400
It's all because I'm useless.

31:37.520 --> 31:38.680
I'm useless.

31:39.840 --> 31:40.800
I…

31:40.880 --> 31:42.840
I just wanted to create

31:43.360 --> 31:45.720
a fair and just world

31:47.640 --> 31:50.480
for you and your mother.

31:56.600 --> 31:57.720
I admit,

31:59.200 --> 32:01.520
the Immortal Alliance
was indeed too extreme before.

32:10.440 --> 32:11.400
Jiang Li,

32:12.760 --> 32:14.160
if you trust me,

32:14.880 --> 32:16.320
I swear here and now,

32:17.320 --> 32:18.480
from this day forward,

32:19.640 --> 32:21.640
no cultivator in the Immortal Alliance
will ever keep spirit slaves again.

32:23.680 --> 32:25.240
Humans and Spirits
will be treated as equals.

32:26.840 --> 32:28.960
If you truly want fairness and justice,

32:29.880 --> 32:31.800
if you want peace between the two clans,

32:32.600 --> 32:33.720
then tell me.

32:34.720 --> 32:36.080
What exactly is He Xianwo planning?

32:54.120 --> 32:56.240
I don't know his full plan,

33:00.680 --> 33:02.040
but I can tell you

33:02.960 --> 33:04.520
he wants to use the power of chaos

33:04.600 --> 33:05.920
to open the Celestial Ladder

33:06.000 --> 33:07.080
and ascend to the Divine Realm.

33:07.760 --> 33:09.480
Does he wish to become a deity?

33:09.560 --> 33:10.640
I don't know.

33:15.080 --> 33:18.480
He Xianwo has been incredibly kind to me.

33:19.640 --> 33:21.440
I can't bring myself to stop him.

33:24.560 --> 33:25.800
Thank you for saving my life.

33:30.680 --> 33:32.040
I've seen how you treat Bao

33:32.680 --> 33:33.960
and Miss Mu

33:34.040 --> 33:36.040
as equals.

33:37.320 --> 33:38.320
I trust you,

33:40.600 --> 33:42.920
but I can't trust anyone else.

33:43.000 --> 33:45.440
I don't believe the centuries of conflict

33:45.520 --> 33:48.080
between Humans and Spirits
can be easily resolved.

33:50.880 --> 33:52.920
This is all I can tell you.

33:55.120 --> 33:56.360
Besides,

33:58.240 --> 33:59.840
I truly don't know where he is.

34:07.640 --> 34:08.960
Sealing the Dark Abyss,

34:09.040 --> 34:10.320
fighting the Fallen Deity,

34:10.400 --> 34:11.800
and aiding the Immortal Alliance…

34:11.880 --> 34:13.639
Tou haven't stopped for a moment.

34:13.719 --> 34:14.760
Xie Xuechen,

34:15.360 --> 34:16.480
aren't you exhausted?

34:20.679 --> 34:23.360
All this way, you've stayed by my side.

34:24.639 --> 34:25.520
Aren't you tired?

34:27.400 --> 34:29.360
Of course I'm tired,

34:29.440 --> 34:30.600
but I chose you, didn't I?

34:31.679 --> 34:33.600
No matter how tough or dangerous it gets,

34:34.800 --> 34:36.880
you can't abandon me.

34:41.840 --> 34:43.800
The Fallen Deity
under the Lava is awakening.

34:45.000 --> 34:46.520
I don't know if what he said

34:47.159 --> 34:48.320
is true or false.

34:51.480 --> 34:52.440
Regardless,

34:53.199 --> 34:54.239
Xie Xuechen,

34:55.080 --> 34:56.080
you must know…

34:57.840 --> 34:59.080
that whether it's Big Brother

34:59.800 --> 35:01.040
or that Fallen Deity,

35:01.720 --> 35:03.000
neither of them is you.

35:03.520 --> 35:04.800
In my heart,

35:05.320 --> 35:07.560
you're not anyone's shadow or substitute.

35:08.600 --> 35:10.440
You're the one and only Xie Xuechen…

35:15.920 --> 35:17.120
and my Xie Xuechen.

35:27.200 --> 35:28.280
It seems

35:29.160 --> 35:30.440
like the situation
is temporarily resolved,

35:31.360 --> 35:32.720
but the problem remains.

35:38.200 --> 35:40.120
The seal on the Dark Abyss
is only temporary.

35:41.920 --> 35:43.280
As long as the inner demons persist,

35:44.000 --> 35:46.360
it's only a matter of time
before the Dark Clan breaks free.

35:46.440 --> 35:47.600
And He Xianwo…

35:48.640 --> 35:50.080
No one knows his intention

35:50.160 --> 35:51.520
or his whereabouts.

35:51.600 --> 35:52.720
He's plotted for years.

35:53.720 --> 35:54.880
He must have a purpose.

35:55.480 --> 35:57.840
There's no way he would abandon
everything without reason.

35:58.800 --> 36:00.000
Mr. Xie!

36:02.480 --> 36:04.800
Why are you in such a rush?
What's happened?

36:04.880 --> 36:06.000
Qiumin has disappeared.

36:06.600 --> 36:07.520
Disappeared?

36:08.080 --> 36:08.920
What happened?

36:09.000 --> 36:10.080
News came from the Mirage Palace

36:10.160 --> 36:11.120
saying Qiumin took her people

36:11.200 --> 36:12.400
to clear the battlefield
and then disappeared.

36:13.520 --> 36:14.920
Where could she have gone?

36:15.000 --> 36:16.120
Could something have happened to her?

36:29.880 --> 36:30.800
Miss Gao, you're awake.

36:32.960 --> 36:34.480
This is today's new tea.

36:35.120 --> 36:36.360
Come have a taste.

36:40.080 --> 36:41.080
Why am I here?

36:44.680 --> 36:46.160
That day at the Starfall Valley,

36:47.800 --> 36:49.600
only five people remained finally.

36:50.760 --> 36:52.000
Apart from the late Sang Qi

36:52.080 --> 36:53.440
and Madam Su,

36:53.520 --> 36:54.520
the others

36:54.600 --> 36:56.160
were Xuechen,

36:56.240 --> 36:57.240
Miss Mu,

36:58.120 --> 36:59.360
and you.

37:00.280 --> 37:02.760
In this great battle,
He Xianwo vanished without a trace.

37:03.640 --> 37:05.080
But he has always desired the Chaos Pearl.

37:05.920 --> 37:07.520
He will undoubtedly hunt down
those who know about it.

37:08.280 --> 37:10.760
And you are one of them.

37:11.440 --> 37:12.800
That's why Xuechen

37:12.880 --> 37:14.520
entrusted me to secretly protect you here.

37:16.720 --> 37:18.880
What's the situation outside now?

37:18.960 --> 37:20.160
Has the Immortal Alliance
defeated the Spirit Clan?

37:21.400 --> 37:23.200
The Dark Clan has joined the battle.

37:24.760 --> 37:26.280
The tide has turned.

37:26.360 --> 37:27.600
The Humans are in defeat,

37:27.680 --> 37:29.400
suffering countless losses.

37:30.360 --> 37:33.120
Right now,
the Chaos Pearl is urgently needed.

37:33.200 --> 37:35.880
We must use its power
to rebuild the Immortals Array.

37:37.680 --> 37:39.400
Xie Xuechen will safeguard
the Chaos Pearl.

37:40.080 --> 37:42.280
How to use it is his decision to make.

37:43.320 --> 37:45.480
Mr. Nan, please take me back
to the Mirage City immediately.

37:45.560 --> 37:46.440
I can't just stand by
and watch the Dark Clan

37:46.520 --> 37:47.680
slaughter the human world.

37:52.080 --> 37:53.400
So, you're saying…

37:55.480 --> 37:56.600
the Chaos Pearl…

37:57.960 --> 37:59.280
is in Xie Xuechen's hands?

38:10.920 --> 38:12.720
I honestly don't know
who has the Chaos Pearl.

38:13.480 --> 38:16.400
You and Xie Xuechen are close friends.

38:16.480 --> 38:19.160
Shouldn't you be asking him instead?

38:23.800 --> 38:24.880
But what if…

38:26.000 --> 38:29.240
I insist on hearing it from you?

38:30.000 --> 38:31.680
Mr. Nan, what are you trying to do?

38:32.240 --> 38:33.960
Are you afraid, Miss Gao?

38:34.040 --> 38:34.880
What is there for me to fear?

38:35.640 --> 38:38.280
Could it be you plan to harm me?

38:39.880 --> 38:41.320
You're joking.

38:42.520 --> 38:43.720
I simply wish

38:44.240 --> 38:46.880
to invite you to admire a painting.

38:48.240 --> 38:51.400
This painting of rivers and mountains
was casually created by me.

38:51.480 --> 38:52.720
It features

38:52.800 --> 38:54.040
mountains, rivers,

38:54.120 --> 38:55.720
flowers, and birds.

38:56.360 --> 38:58.480
But it always feels like
it's missing some soul.

39:00.760 --> 39:02.680
I'm uneducated and know nothing
about appreciating paintings.

39:02.760 --> 39:03.800
I'll head back to the Mirage Palace now.

39:05.360 --> 39:06.800
Nan Xuyue, what are you trying to do?

39:10.000 --> 39:11.880
You seem rather anxious.

39:12.560 --> 39:14.000
Why not take another nap?

39:21.040 --> 39:22.600
Within the fan's realm,

39:23.200 --> 39:24.320
as a figure in the painting,

39:25.280 --> 39:26.880
this landscape and world

39:27.560 --> 39:29.280
are yours alone to enjoy.

39:30.720 --> 39:32.560
That should satisfy you.

39:49.360 --> 39:51.720
Mr. Nan, you seem
rather unkind to a beauty.

39:52.320 --> 39:53.640
You overheard earlier.

39:54.640 --> 39:56.200
The Chaos Pearl is in Xie Xuechen's hands.

39:57.480 --> 39:59.080
But I'm curious.

40:00.320 --> 40:01.920
Sang Qi and Gao Qiumin

40:02.000 --> 40:03.640
stood on completely opposite sides,

40:03.720 --> 40:05.040
even as enemies.

40:05.840 --> 40:07.320
Yet they both tacitly remained silent.

40:08.880 --> 40:10.240
What exactly are they protecting?

40:11.000 --> 40:12.720
Is it the Chaos Pearl

40:13.360 --> 40:14.440
or someone else?

40:16.080 --> 40:17.400
Or could it be

40:18.480 --> 40:20.400
that the Chaos Pearl is this person?

40:22.920 --> 40:24.160
He Xianwo,

40:26.360 --> 40:27.840
give up your thoughts.

40:28.960 --> 40:30.120
I've told you,

40:30.960 --> 40:32.320
if you dare harm her,

40:33.520 --> 40:34.680
I'll destroy you.

40:36.160 --> 40:38.000
Don't you wish to visit
the land of dreams?

40:38.600 --> 40:41.520
Between the one before me
and the dreamland,

40:42.080 --> 40:43.960
if I cannot have both,

40:44.840 --> 40:45.800
I'll protect the former.

40:49.800 --> 40:51.440
Even if the one before you

40:51.520 --> 40:54.240
constantly disregards your feelings
for Xie Xuechen's sake

40:54.880 --> 40:56.280
and even blocks your plans?

41:16.200 --> 41:17.160
Indeed,

41:17.680 --> 41:19.120
it is excellent tea.

41:23.000 --> 41:25.080
The Chaos Pearl is the key
to opening the Celestial Ladder.

41:25.680 --> 41:27.280
As long as the ladder is repaired,

41:27.800 --> 41:29.080
I can spare her life in the end.

41:30.880 --> 41:31.960
But Mr. Nan,

41:33.000 --> 41:34.080
don't tell me

41:34.600 --> 41:36.600
you can't bear to harm her even a little?

41:46.280 --> 41:48.840
What if I truly cannot bear it?

41:50.320 --> 41:52.520
Then why won't you kill Xie Xuechen?

41:53.920 --> 41:55.360
I've told you long ago,

41:55.960 --> 41:57.880
Xie Xuechen's existence is a threat.

41:58.520 --> 42:00.040
Not just to you and me,

42:00.120 --> 42:02.240
but also to Mu Xuanling.

42:02.320 --> 42:03.560
As long as Xie Xuechen lives,

42:03.640 --> 42:06.520
Mu Xuanling will continue

42:06.600 --> 42:07.800
to risk her life by his side,

42:08.400 --> 42:10.040
and one day, she might die.

42:15.000 --> 42:16.560
If you wish to protect Mu Xuanling,

42:17.440 --> 42:18.760
why not join me

42:19.880 --> 42:21.280
and kill Xie Xuechen?

42:25.360 --> 42:27.280
Are you saying Qiumin's disappearance

42:27.880 --> 42:28.960
is related to He Xianwo?

42:31.160 --> 42:32.480
Issue an Alliance Leader's decree.

42:32.560 --> 42:33.600
The entire Immortal Alliance
is to hunt down He Xianwo.

42:33.680 --> 42:34.960
Not just a bounty,

42:35.040 --> 42:36.320
I'll provide a reward of 10,000 gold.

42:37.280 --> 42:38.400
No,

42:38.480 --> 42:40.800
no matter how much gold,
I will find Qiumin.

42:53.920 --> 42:54.920
She'll be alright.

42:55.000 --> 42:56.320
Don't lose your focus.

42:57.600 --> 42:59.120
Lose my focus?

42:59.200 --> 43:01.160
What's my relationship with Gao Qiumin?

43:01.240 --> 43:03.480
I hate her the most.
She better be in trouble.

43:04.080 --> 43:05.160
Is that so?

43:06.440 --> 43:07.280
Of course.

43:10.400 --> 43:11.560
You don't truly hate her,

43:12.080 --> 43:13.040
do you?

43:16.880 --> 43:18.240
Who really holds

43:18.320 --> 43:19.840
onto childhood grudges for life?

43:21.080 --> 43:22.200
Too many have already fallen

43:22.720 --> 43:24.040
in this battle.

43:25.400 --> 43:26.560
As for Gao Qiumin,

43:27.800 --> 43:29.040
I won't allow her to die.
